  <origin Name="Cleo_TerraFirma_QuarryWarren">
    <displayName>quarry warren</displayName>
    <title>{{w|quarry}}&#xA;warren</title>
    <category>Standard</category>
    <region>DesertCanyon</region>
    <description>
      {{c|&#x2219;}} Random quarry warren in the desert canyons.
      {{c|&#x2219;}} Warren teaches Deft Throwing.
      {{c|&#x2219;}} +100 reputation with the Quarriers' Guild.
    </description>
    <opening>
      <p>On the =day= of =month=, you arrive at the quarry warren of {{g|=village=}}.</p>
      <p>Quarriers from the far {{w|Sunderlies}} pry red stone from the canyon walls, portioning out each brick they owe to their guild across the salt.</p>
      <p>Dust clings to the arid air, and the scuttling of kept centipedes underpins the steady ringing of hammers on stone.</p>
      <p>On the horizon, {{r|Qud's}} jungles strangle chrome steeples and rusted archways to the earth.</p>
      <p>Further and beyond, the fabled {{C|Spindle}} rises above the fray and pierces the cloud-ribboned sky.</p>
    </opening>
    <module>Cleo_TerraFirma_RandomWarren</module>
    <state Name="RuinedJoppa">Yes</state>
    <state Name="Cleo_TerraFirma_WarrenStart">Yes</state>
